#: Youtube_settings.py:308
msgid ""
"How to get YouTube cookies:\n"
"\n"
"1. Install 'Get cookies.txt' extension in Chrome or Firefox\n"
"2. Login to YouTube in your browser\n"
"3. Click the extension icon and export cookies\n"
"4. Save as cookies.txt and select it here\n"
"\n"
"Using cookies helps avoid blocks because YouTube sees you as a logged-in user.\n"
msgstr ""
"Cara mendapatkan kuki YouTube:\n"
"\n"
"1. Pasang sambungan 'Get cookies.txt' dalam Chrome atau Firefox\n"
"2. Log masuk ke YouTube dalam pelayar anda\n"
"3. Klik ikon sambungan dan eksport kuki\n"
"4. Simpan sebagai cookies.txt dan pilih di sini\n"
"\n"
"Menggunakan kuki membantu mengelakkan sekatan kerana YouTube melihat anda sebagai pengguna yang telah log masuk.\n"

